hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"119","[AI-translation] Hum se hadith bayan ki Mahmood bin Gheelan ne, kaha: Hum se hadith bayan ki Abu Dawud ne, Shubah se, Al-Ash'ath bin Suleem se, kehte hain: Maine apni phupi ko suna, jo apne chacha se hadith bayan karti thi, kehne lagin: Main Madine mein chal raha tha, achanak mere peechay ek shaks ne kaha: Apna izar upar utha, kyunke yeh zyada taqwa wala aur zyada baqi rehne wala hai. Maine dekha toh woh Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam thay. Maine kaha: Ya Rasoolallah! Yeh toh sirf ek burdah malha hai. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhare liye meri zat mein namona nahi hai? Maine dekha toh aap ka izar pindaliyon ke nisf tak tha."
"120","[AI-translation] Hum se hadith bayan ki Suwaid bin Nasr, kaha: Hum se hadith bayan ki Abdullah bin Al-Mubarak, Musa bin Ubaidah se, Iyas bin Salamah bin Al-Akwa se, apne walid se, kehte hain: Uthman bin Affan izar pindaliyon ke adhay tak bandhte the, aur farmate: Isi tarah mere sahib ka izar tha, yani Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka."
"121","[AI-translation] Hum se hadith bayan ki Qutaibah bin Saeed, kaha: Hum se hadith bayan ki Abu Al-Ahwash, Abu Ishaq se, Muslim bin Nazeer se, Huzaifah bin Al-Yaman se, kehte hain: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne meri pindali ke puthay ya apni pindali ke puthay ko pakra aur farmaya: Yeh izar ka muqam hai, pas agar inkar karo toh niche, aur agar inkar karo toh kaffain par izar ka koi haq nahi."
